Jab tum Instagram pe photo upload karte ho — woh photo kahan jaati hai?"
"Jab Zomato pe order karte ho — tumhara order restaurant tak kaise pahunchta hai?"
"Jab Netflix pe movie play karte ho — woh movie tumhare phone mein thi nahi — toh aayi kahan se?"

"Yeh sab kaam karta hai — Backend ki wajah se। Aur backend banane ke liye — aaj se hum Node.js seekhenge।"
"Is course ke end mein — tumhare paas ek poora working backend hoga। Server, APIs, Database, Authentication — sab kuch। Chalte hain।"

